@startuml 008-mode-timed-scoring-sequence
title 008 mode-timed-scoring：時序圖（一題的完整回合）

actor "老師" as T
actor "第1組" as A
actor "第2組" as B
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "計時器任務" as Timer
participant "views" as V

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/open-next
App -> Act : open_next()
Act -> Act : 檢查 answering、sequential、current 為 None
Act -> Act : rounds[1] = Round(opened_at = clock())
Act -> Timer : create_task(睡 time_limit 秒)
App --> A : 推播 round{question: 1, state: open, deadline_epoch_ms}
App --> B : 推播（同上）

A -> App : POST /api/student/submit {question: 1, answers}
App -> Act : submit(第1組, 1, answers)
Act -> Act : 題號 = current、未關閉、clock() - opened_at <= limit
Act -> Act : elapsed_ms = (clock() - opened_at) × 1000
App --> A : {question, answers}
note right of App : 第2組 view 不變，不推送

Timer -> Act : close_due()
Act -> Act : clock() - opened_at >= limit -> closed
App --> A : 推播 round.state = closed
App --> B : 推播 round.state = closed

B -> App : POST /api/student/submit {question: 1, …}（太晚）
App --> B : 409 本題作答時間已到

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/judge {question: 1, team: 第1組, correct: true}
T -> App : POST /api/teacher/reveal-question
App -> Act : reveal_question()（已關閉且無未判定）
App -> V : student_view：revealed（本組）＋ my_total ＋ leaderboard（名次，不含他組分數）
V -> V : TimedRule：timed_points(elapsed_ms, limit, multiplier)
App --> A : 推播 本組 +分數、各組名次
App --> B : 推播 本組未作答 0 分、各組名次（不含第1組答案與分數）
@enduml
